%%voicemap drummap  % activate abcm2ps/abc2svg map
%%MIDI channel 10   % activate abc2midi map
%
   D        E          F          G          A             |
w: pedal    bass       acoustic   low\-floor high\-floor 
w: hi\-hat  drum~1     bass~drum  tom\-tom   tom\-tom 
%
   B        ^B         c          _c         ^c            |
w: low      tambourine acoustic   electric   low
w: tom\-tom *          snare      snare      wood~block
%
   =c       d          ^d         e          ^e            |
w: side     low\-mid   high       high\-mid  cowbell
w: stick    tom\-tom   wood~block tom\-tom   *
%
   f        ^f         g          ^g         a        ^a   |
w: high     ride       closed     open       crash    open
w: tom\-tom cymbal~1   hi\-hat    hi\-hat    cymbal~1 triangle

